<title>UK: BOXING-COLLINS RETAINS TITLE AS BENN RETIRES.</title>
<headline>BOXING-COLLINS RETAINS TITLE AS BENN RETIRES.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's Steve Collins retained his World Boxing Organisation (WBO) super-middleweight title after Briton Nigel Benn retired at the end of the sixth round of their championship bout on Saturday.</p>
</text>
